-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_yellow_submarine_ep-200x197.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_yellow_submarine_ep-580x571.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_yellow_submarine_ep-960x945.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_yellow_submarine_ep-768x756.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_yellow_submarine_ep-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_yellow_submarine_ep.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9346\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/france_yellow_submarine_ep/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_yellow_submarine_ep.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,984\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Yellow Submarine EP artwork \u2013 France\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/france_yellow_submarine_ep-960x945.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/mexico_yellow_submarine_ep_02/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/mexico_yellow_submarine_ep_02-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Yellow Submarine EP artwork - Mexico\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/mexico_yellow_submarine_ep_02-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/mexico_yellow_submarine_ep_02-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/mexico_yellow_submarine_ep_02-960x960.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/mexico_yellow_submarine_ep_02-768x768.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/mexico_yellow_submarine_ep_02-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/mexico_yellow_submarine_ep_02.jpg 964w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9778\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/mexico_yellow_submarine_ep_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/mexico_yellow_submarine_ep_02.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"964,964\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Yellow Submarine EP artwork \u2013 Mexico\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/mexico_yellow_submarine_ep_02-960x960.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/netherlands_yellow_submarine/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk1IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5NSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"195\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_yellow_submarine-200x195.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Yellow Submarine/Eleanor Rigby single artwork - Netherlands\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_yellow_submarine-200x195.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_yellow_submarine-580x565.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_yellow_submarine-960x935.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_yellow_submarine-768x748.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_yellow_submarine.jpg 978w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9820\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/netherlands_yellow_submarine/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_yellow_submarine.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"978,953\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Yellow Submarine/Eleanor Rigby single artwork \u2013 Netherlands\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_yellow_submarine-960x935.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/portugal_yellow_submarine_ep/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/portugal_yellow_submarine_ep-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Yellow Submarine EP artwork - Portugal\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/portugal_yellow_submarine_ep-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/portugal_yellow_submarine_ep-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/portugal_yellow_submarine_ep-958x960.jpg 958w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/portugal_yellow_submarine_ep-768x770.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/portugal_yellow_submarine_ep-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/portugal_yellow_submarine_ep.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"10002\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/portugal_yellow_submarine_ep/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/portugal_yellow_submarine_ep.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,1002\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Yellow Submarine EP artwork \u2013 Portugal\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/portugal_yellow_submarine_ep-958x960.jpg\" /></a></div></figure></div><p>In the US it fared less well upon its <a href=\"/1966/08/08/us-single-eleanor-rigby-yellow-submarine/\">8 August</a> release. It spent six weeks in the top 40 after charting at number 11 on 10 September. The single peaked at number two on the <em>Billboard</em> Hot 100 and <em>Cashbox</em> charts.</p><p>The controversy over the &#8216;butcher cover&#8217; and <a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John Lennon</a>\u2019s &#8220;<a href=\"/1966/03/04/how-does-a-beatle-live-by-maureen-cleave/\">more popular than Jesus</a>\u201d comments are believed to have contributed to the failure to reach number one in all US charts. However, it sold 1.2 million copies in four weeks.</p><div class=\"fab-forum-link\"><a href=\"/fab-forum/the-songs/yellow-submarine/\">Discuss &#8216;Yellow Submarine&#8217; on the Fab Forum \u00bb</a></div><div class=\"wp-post-navigation\"><div class=\"wp-post-navigation-pre\"> <strong>Previous song:</strong> <a href=\"/songs/here-there-and-everywhere/\">&#8216;Here, There And Everywhere&#8217;</a></div><div class=\"wp-post-navigation-next\"> <strong>Next song:</strong> <a href=\"/songs/she-said-she-said/\">&#8216;She Said She Said&#8217;</a></div></div><div align=\"center\" style=\"clear:both;margin:15px 0;\"></div><div class=\"page-links\">Pages: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/yellow-submarine/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">1</span></a> <span class=\"post-page-numbers current\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"page-link\">2</span></span></div>",
